  "description": "Operating Area: Amalfi Coast, Sardinia, Pontine Islands, Tuscany, Sicily, Aeolian Islands, Liguria and Cinque Terre, Italy\n\nWelcome aboard the Ferretti INFYNITO 80 TRILOGY. Designed for guests who want to live as much of their charter outdoors as possible, this yacht turns sheltered spaces into the best seats on the water. The signature covered terrace is an elegant extension of the superstructure that reads like a private rooftop room at sea: sheltered, intimate and panoramic.\n\nYou and your guests will find 4 spacious cabins below deck, laid out for maximum comfort and privacy. One cabin converts easily from twin to double, so the layout adapts to families, friends or mixed groups - and to last-minute changes of plan. Advanced stabilizers work both underway and at anchor to reduce roll and fatigue, so passages feel smoother and evenings at anchor are more restful. The result: longer, more enjoyable cruises and more usable time on board for everyone.\n\nA professional, experienced crew of four is on hand to look after navigation, safety and hospitality. Expect discreet, attentive service: meals prepared to your schedule, expertly handled tender and water-sport operations, and knowledgeable local advice to make each stop effortless and memorable.\n\nFerretti INFYNITO 80 incorporates F.S.E.A. (Ferretti Sustainable Enhanced Architecture), with visible, guest-facing choices such as natural textiles and bamboo-fibre fabrics, regenerated leathers and recyclable materials. These details create a refined, contemporary interior that’s conscious of its environmental footprint - so your charter can feel luxurious and responsible at the same time.\n\nStep aboard INFYNITO 80 TRILOGY for relaxed mornings, lively afternoons and quiet nights under the stars - everything arranged so you can simply enjoy the sea. ",
